// AWS IAM Role Created  [tier: hunt]  ATT&CK: T1098.003
// Detects creation of a new IAM role (CreateRole). Attackers create roles (often with permissive trust) as a persistence and escalation…
// False positives: Routine role creation by platform/IaC.
// Source: rules/privilege-escalation/iam-create-role.yml — generated by scripts/build_dist.py; adjust field names to your CloudTrail schema.
from * metadata _id, _index, _version | where eventName=="CreateRole" and eventSource=="iam.amazonaws.com"
